**Required decision before Phase 4a V1 starts**:
- Re-capture V13 CLIENT baseline with Profiler Recording enabled (M1), OR
- Accept a gc-alloc-only V13 gate for Phase 4a and defer rep-*-ms gates to Phase 4b / post-refactor (M2), OR
- Switch to Stopwatch timing (M2 code change, minor scope addition to probes PR or a follow-up micro-PR).

